<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending up 2.5 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending up 2.5 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 2.5 percent year-on-year in August, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  Aug 1996   July 1996	 Aug 1995</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +2.5%	 +3.0% (r)	+2.6%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +4.3%	 +5.0% (r)	+7.1%</p>
<p>Deposits		+5.2%	 +5.2% (r)	-1.0%</p>
<p>Note - (r) means the data has been revised.</p>
</text>
